# Web — estructura de carpetas

## Capas (`apps/web/src/`)

| Capa | Uso |
|------|-----|
| `app/` | Router, routes, navigation registry |
| `features/` | Dominio de producto (1 ítem navbar = 1 feature) |
| `shared/` | API client, UI reutilizable (`@/shared` ≠ `@aio-app/shared`) |
| `core/` | Auth, guards, providers globales |
| `layouts/` | Shell (RootLayout, Navbar, Header) |
| `theme/` | Mantine theme |

## Cada feature

```
features/<name>/
  <name>.routes.tsx
  <name>.page.tsx
  <name>.nav.tsx          # si va al menú
  index.ts                # solo exports públicos
  modules/<module>/
    components/<Component>/<Component>.tsx + index.ts
    hooks/useX/useX.ts + index.ts
  modules/_shared/        # código compartido entre módulos del mismo feature
```

## Reglas de imports

- `@/shared/api`, `@/core/auth`, `@/layouts/...`
- **Prohibido:** `features/A` → `features/B`
- UI usada en 2+ features → `shared/ui/`
- Nav: `<name>.nav.tsx` + registrar en `app/navigation/nav-registry.tsx`

## Scaffolding

```bash
pnpm web:new-feature <name> --register-route --register-nav
```

Ver `docs/web-new-feature.md` y `docs/web-tooling.md`.

## Features de referencia

| Feature | Cuándo copiar |
|---------|----------------|
| `home` | Feature simple, un módulo, sin SWR |
| `media` | Multi-módulo (`search`, `library`, `_shared`), hooks SWR + mutations |
| `profile` | Forms Mantine, PATCH utils, `useProfile`, security actions |
